/** MUTANT `acknowledgement-lives-in-the-heap` (throwaway; NEVER committed):
 *  the warning ack is WRITTEN durably and READ from process memory. Every
 *  pre-restart assertion in the PR6 family still passes; only a store opened
 *  over the same directory can tell the difference — which is exactly what
 *  spec §21.10 "warning acknowledgement reconstructs" forbids. */
const IN_PROCESS_ACKS = new Map<string, GovernanceWarningAcknowledgement>()

